{"id":"vod_bf_1295","vodId":"1295","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"暗杀教室第二季","name_cn":"暗杀教室第二季","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-2/87a11802edb4572ecbf7dd1dd810bb8c.jpg"},"summary":"经过南国小岛上和鹰冈的决斗，3年E班的各位与杀老师（福山润 配音）的关系进一步拉近。虽然暗杀活动仍在继续，然而这似乎已经变成了师生之间互动玩乐的重要环节。以茅野枫（洲崎绫 配音）为代表的学生们又开始策划更加精彩的暗杀陷阱。除此之外，他们帮助比琪老师（伊藤静 配音）追求乌间惟臣（杉田智和 配音），又或者磨刀霍霍与A班的精英们展开荣誉与尊严之战。与此同时，白先生带领堀部系成（绪方惠美 配音）卷土重来，而神秘的死神则将E班推向各位凶险的境地。随着最后期限一天天逼近，杀老师和学生们的关系变得愈加微妙……　　本片根据松井优征的超人气漫画改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 22:20:41","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/anshajiaoshidierji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/anshajiaoshidierji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/anshajiaoshidierji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/anshajiaoshidierji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/anshajiaoshidierji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/anshajiaoshidierji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/anshajiaoshidierji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/anshajiaoshidierji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/anshajiaoshidierji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/anshajiaoshidierji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/anshajiaoshidierji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/anshajiaoshidierji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/anshajiaoshidierji/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/